# pipenv
#   According to pypa.io/pipenv/what-is-pipenv.html "EP 20: Pipenv and Lockfile are
#   stored in the project's root directory, (Pipfile, Pipfile.lock)."
#   Commented above as it assumes the repo is the library init.
#   Not adapting this in case existing projects rely on it.
Pipfile
Pipfile.lock

# Poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, Poetry stores it's lockfile in the project root.
#   Commented above as it assumes the repo is the library init.
#   Not adapting this in case existing projects rely on it.
poetry.lock
